  "measurement_notes": [
    "Each sample used a fresh venv and separate empty uv cache. Pair order: baseline/candidate, candidate/baseline, baseline/candidate.",
    "Source overlay and interpreter provision happened before measurement; source, interpreter, and OS packages are excluded from size.",
    "Regular-file logical bytes do not follow symlinks. Venv and uv cache can share hardlinks; do not add their sizes as physical savings.",
    "Aoi lock and pyproject were unchanged; candidate omitted only the five named direct distributions and retained all other real-phase distributions, including anyio.",
    "Same source, pytest configuration, read-only observer and normal plugin autoload in both modes. PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 in both modes.",
    "Pipeline process seconds sum the two syncs, selected pytest, real collect, failed Polars import and minimal collect. Provenance checkout, pip/inventory checks and hashing are excluded.",
    "OS/CDN caches and unrelated host load were not controlled. All six samples retained; no measured command retried.",
    "Six unchanged tests passed without skips per sample. All18phase reports, collection IDs, rootdir/config and external plugin inventories matched.",
    "Reference/minimal JSON matched within every sample and across all samples. The reports derive from the same pinned Aoi research records, not new observations.",
    "These are local environment measurements, not hosted CI runtime or billing measurements.",
    "Shared per-mode commands and package inventories are factored into environment_profiles; each sample was independently checked against its mode profile."
